2026-07-07 17:21:57 | USER: What kind of activities are organized during this week?
2026-07-07 17:21:58 | ASSISTANT: guided campus and town tour, IT and library introduction, registering at the residents' registration office, obtaining a residence permit, intercultural training, a Bavarian Evening, and various day trips
